Recommends: gpsd | geoclue-2.0
Description: Offline maps with routing and search
 CoMaps with a Qt Quick interface: offline OpenStreetMap maps, search,
 routing and turn-by-turn navigation. The position comes from gpsd where
 it runs (phones that feed their GNSS to it), from geoclue otherwise.
 In the Hildon session of Maemo Leste with stacked windows and the app menu.
